tal in New Zealand\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</header>\n\t\t\n\t\n</div>\n\n\n<div id=\"MainContent\"></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"page-content\">\n\t\n<div class=\"container-fluid my-5\">\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"row mb-4\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-md-7\">\n\t\t\t<img class=\"my-3 triangle-icon\" src=\"/_resources/themes/site/dist/images/triangle.svg?m=1783282186\" alt=\"\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"display-4\">Achieving greatness through collaboration.</h2>\n\t\t\t<p>It takes a village to raise a child \u2013 and we believe it\u2019s the same in business. That\u2019s why we partner with other investors with aspirations of achieving great things to give Kiwi innovators the leg up that they need to succeed.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"row feature-links\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-md-3\">\n\t\t\t<h3>Here&#039;s how we can help you</h3>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"col-md-8 offset-md-1\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row page-blocks\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card text-black border-top border-bottom py-3 h-100\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-body h-100\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><a href=\"/funding/aspire-seed-fund\">Aspire NZ Seed Fund</a></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>For the young and daring, those just getting started and with stacks of ambition. We help the risk-takers and big-thinkers - with ideas that are a little rough around the edges - to grow. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur Aspire fund invests directly into early-stage Kiwi technology start-ups at proof of concept, seed, and early expansion investment stages.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/funding/aspire-seed-fund\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLearn more\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card text-black border-top border-bottom py-3 h-100\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-body h-100\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><a href=\"/funding/elevate-venture-fund\">Elevate NZ Venture Fund</a></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>For the passionate and committed venture capital firms looking to help Kiwi tech companies develop onto the world stage. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nElevate is a $300m government-funded fund of funds, that invests into venture capital funds; aimed at filling the Series A and B capital gap for high-growth New Zealand tech companies.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/funding/elevate-venture-fund\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLearn more\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card text-black border-top border-bottom py-3 h-100\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-body h-100\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><a href=\"https://outlook.office.com/book/&#65;&#x70;&#112;&#x6c;&#105;&#x63;&#97;&#x74;&#105;&#x6f;&#110;&#x73;&#64;&#x6e;&#122;&#x67;&#99;&#x70;&#46;&#x63;&#111;&#x2e;&#110;&#x7a;/?ismsaljsauthenabled\">Aspire Venture Hours</a></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>For founders who want to sharpen their pitch and get investment-ready. Aspire Venture Hours provide 25-minute sessions where Kiwi start-up founders can share their ideas, receive feedback, and strengthen their pathway to investment. Timeslots are booked online and allocated on a first come, first served basis.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://outlook.office.com/book/&#65;&#x70;&#112;&#x6c;&#105;&#x63;&#97;&#x74;&#105;&#x6f;&#110;&#x73;&#64;&#x6e;&#122;&#x67;&#99;&#x70;&#46;&#x63;&#111;&#x2e;&#110;&#x7a;/?ismsaljsauthenabled\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSchedule a Meeting\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card text-black border-top border-bottom py-3 h-100\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-body h-100\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><a href=\"/about-us/news-and-media/news\">Market Development</a></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>New Zealand creates technology for a better tomorrow, and we have an ecosystem full of support to back our bold entrepreneurs. To assist with market development, we sponsor a series of initiatives and programmes that help fill the gaps and encourage capability-building for both founders and investors.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/about-us/news-and-media/news\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tView our sponsorships\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"bg-blue home-featured \"\n\t\n>\n\t<div class=\"blue-overlay\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"container-fluid my-5 pt-3 pb-5\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-5\">\n\t\t\t\t<img class=\"my-3 triangle-icon\" src=\"/_resources/themes/site/dist/images/triangle-white.svg?m=1783282186\" alt=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2>Dealroom: New Zealand&#039;s start-up database</h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p>Explore and follow the performance of New Zealand's tech start-ups + investors.&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"mb-4\">Register to view data or claim / update your company profile.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href=\"/about-us/news-and-media/resources/dealroom\"><b>Learn more</b></a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/about-us/news-and-media/resources/dealroom\" class=\"feature-image-small\">\n